<title>INDIA: India Flex Industries 6-month net rises.</title>
<headline>India Flex Industries 6-month net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     173.5  vs    170.6</p>
<p>    Sales		  2,270.7  vs  2,177.3</p>
<p>    Other income	    48.7  vs     32.2</p>
<p>     Total expenditure  1,684.9  vs  1,703.4</p>
<p>    Interest		 320.6  vs    229.2</p>
<p>    Gross profit	   634.5  vs    506.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   140.4  vs    106.3</p>
<p>    Tax			  nil  vs	 nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Flex Industries Ltd said in a statement that the provision for tax would be considered at the time of annual results.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
